<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Italian War of 1551–1559</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1551">1551</a>–<a href="/years/1559">1559</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Habsburg–Valois War · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-wars">Italian Wars</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Italian War of 1551–1559 was the last of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-wars">Italian Wars</a>, fought between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/henry-ii-of-france">Henry II of France</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/habsburg-dynasty">Habsburgs</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-v-holy-roman-emperor">Charles V</a> and then <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/philip-ii-of-spain">Philip II of Spain</a>, with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a> joining <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a> in 1557. After Spanish victories at St Quentin (1557) and Gravelines (1558) and the French capture of Calais, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-cateau-cambresis">Peace of Cateau-Cambrésis</a> (1559) confirmed Spanish dominance in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/italian-war-of-1551-1559.jpg" alt="Italian War of 1551–1559" width="320" height="189" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Giorgio Vasari · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scannagallo_Vasari.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section><h2 class="enc-section-title">Battles and settlements</h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/war-of-parma"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/war-of-parma.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">War of Parma</span><span class="tp">War · 1551–1552</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-marciano"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-marciano.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Battle of Marciano</span><span class="tp">Battle · 1554</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-saint-quentin-1557"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-saint-quentin-1557.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Battle of Saint-Quentin (1557)</span><span class="tp">Battle · 1557</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-gravelines-1558"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-gravelines-1558.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Battle of Gravelines (1558)</span><span class="tp">Battle · 1558</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-cateau-cambresis"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/peace-of-cateau-cambresis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Peace of Cateau-Cambrésis</span><span class="tp">Treaty · Peace · 1559</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
